WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,320
Isn’t it equivalent to a sky-high price of 20 trillion?

2
00:00:02,320 --> 00:00:03,240
You wait here

3
00:00:03,240 --> 00:00:05,360
I immediately asked the top leadership of the headquarters for instructions

4
00:00:06,940 --> 00:00:08,180
Headquarters agreed

5
00:00:08,180 --> 00:00:09,860
As long as the supply can continue in the future

6
00:00:09,860 --> 00:00:12,060
The state can grant you a license to continue public auctions

7
00:00:12,060 --> 00:00:14,100
But the principle of reciprocity must be observed

8
00:00:14,100 --> 00:00:17,050
Every time there is a public auction on the market

9
00:00:17,050 --> 00:00:20,600
You must pay a fixed agreement price of 5.1 billion

10
00:00:20,600 --> 00:00:23,760
A case was secretly delivered to the national special department

11
00:00:24,780 --> 00:00:26,860
Although this price is lower than the auction

12
00:00:26,860 --> 00:00:29,140
But once Fliggy enters the market, the number will increase

13
00:00:29,140 --> 00:00:30,740
The unit price will inevitably plummet

14
00:00:30,740 --> 00:00:33,220
Five billion is the long-term guaranteed cloud supply price.

15
00:00:33,220 --> 00:00:34,660
reasonable

16
00:00:34,660 --> 00:00:36,620
Wait until I contact my friends

17
00:00:36,620 --> 00:00:38,230
See if he answers or not

18
00:00:38,230 --> 00:00:40,320
You can't contact me now

19
00:00:40,320 --> 00:00:42,670
Where does the signal come from in the deep mountains and old forests?

20
00:00:42,670 --> 00:00:44,550
I'll give you the final answer tomorrow morning

21
00:00:44,550 --> 00:00:46,470
Take this flying pig back and revive it first.

22
00:00:46,470 --> 00:00:47,870
It’s a deal

23
00:00:47,870 --> 00:00:48,870
See you tomorrow

24
00:00:48,870 --> 00:00:50,910
Activate safe contact mechanism

25
00:00:50,910 --> 00:00:53,030
Protect samples and personnel

26
00:00:53,030 --> 00:00:55,310
Verify follow-up transaction clues in accordance with the law

27
00:00:55,310 --> 00:00:56,990
Do not invade Zhang Tong’s personal space
